OL,3,GNEWSAEx-homeless man backs Burnham
OL,4,Arough sleeping pledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FAndy Burnham's pledge to end rough
OL,7,Fsleeping would be "some achievement", a
OL,8,Fformer homeless man says.
OL,10,FSteven Baugh, from Deal, Kent, said he
OL,11,Fwould "believe it when they actually
OL,12,Fstart doing something", but that he
OL,13,Fsupported Burnham's plans to offer all
OL,14,Frough sleepers accommodation for
OL,15,FChristmas, or a route off the streets.
OL,17,FKent charity Porchlight welcomed the
OL,18,Fproposals but warned they could be an
OL,19,F"over-simplification of a systemic
OL,20,Fissue", and that the issue "will need
OL,21,Flong-term investment".
OL,23,APub: 27-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
