OL,3,GNEWSAEx-homeless man backs Burnham
OL,4,Arough sleeping pledge
OL,5,
OL,6,FA government spokesperson said Burnham
OL,7,Fis determined to end rough sleeping
OL,8,Facross the country "at the earliest
OL,9,Fopportunity".
